[00:00.60] 作词 : David Gilmour/Phil Manzanera
[00:01.60] 作曲 : David Gilmour/Phil Manzanera
[01:10.50]A restless eye across a weary room
[01:10.50]躁动的眼神越过索然无味的房间
[01:18.45]A glazed look and I was on the road to ruin
[01:18.45]一副呆滞的神情正走在通往毁灭的路上
[01:26.13]The music played and played as we whirled without end
[01:26.13]音乐不停地播放而我们无休无止地旋转
[01:34.86]No hint no word her honour to defend
[01:34.86]没有头绪也没有借口去捍卫她的荣耀
[01:43.06]I will I will she sighed to my request
[01:43.06]我会的我会的但她却对我的恳请一阵唏嘘
[01:50.41]And then she tossed her mane
[01:50.41]然后甩了甩辫子
[01:52.64]While my resolve was put to the test
[01:52.64]而我下定决心毅然一试
[01:58.84]Then drowned in desire our souls on fire
[01:58.84]不一会儿淹没在欲望中连灵魂也激动乱颤
[02:02.96]I lead the way to the funeral pyre
[02:02.96]我朝着火葬场走去
[02:07.11]And without a thought of the consequence
[02:07.11]完全义无反顾不计后果
[02:11.19]I gave in to my decadence
[02:11.19]我最终让步于堕落
[02:15.60]One slip and down the hole we fall
[02:15.60]一次失足让我们都坠入洞中
[02:23.48]It seems to take no time at all
[02:23.48]似乎已经没有时间了
[02:31.61]A momentary lapse of reason
[02:31.61]皆因一念之间一时糊涂
[02:35.46]That binds a life for life
[02:35.46]为了生活被拖下水来
[02:39.66]A small regret you won't forget
[02:39.66]你将为这小小的失误抱撼终身
[02:43.57]There'll be no sleep in here tonight
[02:43.57]而今晚也别想安然入睡
[02:47.01]
[03:41.85]Was it love or was it the idea of being in love ？
[03:41.85]那是爱吗抑或只是爱的缘起
[03:48.89]Or was it the hand of fate
[03:48.89]还是那只不过是命运之手的捉弄
[03:51.36]That seemed to fit just like a glove
[03:51.36]似乎不多不少恰到好处
[03:57.56]The moment slipped by and soon the seeds were sown
[03:57.56]此刻失足滑倒同时也播下了罪恶的种子
[04:05.58]The year grew late and neither one wanted to remain alone
[04:05.58]年复一年不再有人愿意独自苟活
[04:14.45]One slip and down the hole we fall
[04:14.45]一次失足让我们都坠入洞中
[04:22.14]It seems to take no time at all
[04:22.14]似乎已经没有时间了
[04:30.21]A momentary lapse of reason
[04:30.21]皆因一念之间一时糊涂
[04:34.12]That binds a life for life
[04:34.12]为了生活被拖下水来
[04:38.38]A small regret you won't forget
[04:38.38]你将为这小小的失误抱撼终身
